// The stealth lane's light levels (DishonoredVisibilityComponent.m_fCurrentLightValue /
// _Normalized) measured on the original's Playground with the player sneaking at each point
// (hook round 4, 2026-10-08), against the port's light probe (pawn.light / pawn.light01,
// Crowd::player_light). The player is teleported to each point (crouched, as measured) and
// sampled 25 ticks later. (500, 6600) and every point east read the darkest value (0.1838).
// Port: the stealth light environment (stealth.md sections 11 and 14): the layout's lights, Boyle's
// dominant directional and sky light, unoccluded (the original builds the layout from movable
// InterpActor cubes, which a TRACE_ShadowCast line check ignores), raw light (L / 4 pi)^(1/2.2).
